### Settings wire-up

`main_menu.gd._on_settings_pressed` used to show "Settings coming soon"
as a notification. Now:
- checks for an existing SettingsPanel under HudLayer
- opens it if present
- otherwise instantiates a fresh SettingsPanel as an overlay
- threads the current LoginService account_id (or '' for guest) through
  to satisfy `UIPanel.open(player_id: String)`

### world_playable.tscn engine noise (still benign)

The engine still logs "Script inherits from native type
'CharacterBody3D'..." at scene load. The script/class references in
the .tscn file all check out (Player is CharacterBody3D, all child
scripts match their node types). Scene still loads, all 7/7 hud
integration tests pass. The warning is non-fatal; suspect stale
PackedScene cache from earlier revisions. Not blocking.

